    "title": "Land cover Kef-Siliana region (2017)",
    "description": "Land cover map of the Kef-Siliana region, Tunisia, for 2017, produced by ICARDA from ESRI Sentinel-2 Land Cover Explorer rasters (ArcGIS Living Atlas of the World), 10 m cell size. Classes 1 Water; 2 Forest; 4 Flooded vegetation; 5 Crop; 7 Built area; 8 Bare land; 11 Rangeland. Source data coordinate system UTM WGS 84; service coordinate system Web Mercator Auxiliary Sphere WGS 84 (EPSG:3857). Published on ICARDA's MEL data portal with data dictionaries; MOSAIC links to it there.",
